%% UC-11 — Create implementation intention
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (intentionService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Select behaviour, cue(s), duration
    F->>F: Compose if-then statement ("After dinner, I will walk for 20 minutes.")
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/habits/intentions {behaviorKey, cues, durationMinutes, intentionStatement}
    B->>M: count(implementation_intentions, {userId, status: "active"})
    M-->>B: activeCount
    alt activeCount >= maxHabits
        B-->>F: 409 habit cap reached
    else under cap
        B->>M: insert(implementation_intentions {status: "active", enrollmentId, studyId, groupId})
        M-->>B: _id
        B-->>F: 201 intention created
    end
